        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6kriko-07tpysfe7r",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Codex"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to Ilha Grande, first by car and then by shared boat. Check in at the hotel and take time to rest.\n\nThe island has no cars. Tropical vegetation covers most of it, with beaches and small bays along the coast. People get around by boat or on foot, so the pace changes noticeably after Rio. There is less city noise here, and the landmarks are piers, forested slopes, beaches and the water between the islands."
